title: "Clinical Trial Decision Lab: a reproducible benchmark of AI decision models for clinical-trial evidence work"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jerzy
    family-names: Pietruszewski
    affiliation: Smart Mobile House
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-26
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24562228
repository-code: "https://github.com/SmartMobileHouse/clinical-trial-decision-lab"
url: "https://smartmobilehouse.com/research/clinical-trial-decision-lab/"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark of AI decision models, general-purpose LLMs and trained classifiers for
  clinical-trial evidence work. The screening study predicts whether a systematic review included or
  excluded a paper from the review title and the paper's abstract. The repository also holds a
  synthetic benchmark for triage of enrollment-eligibility and informed-consent issues. Research
  only; not validated by clinical experts.
keywords:
  - clinical trials
  - systematic reviews
  - study screening
  - benchmark
  - decision models
  - large language models
